    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443660/extras/e3febca91b760a2bacd08dcc08940877.avif?t=1755275780\" width=616 height=109 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After an unfortunate accident leaves the protagonist (default name: Seiya) without a home or any means of survival, a lifeline arrives in the form of an invitation from his distant uncle. It\u2019s a chance to start fresh on a peaceful island, far from the bustle of civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But things don\u2019t go as expected. Upon arriving, Seiya discovers his uncle is nowhere to be found. Instead, he\u2019s greeted by Hana, a bright and playful young woman who turns out to be his long-forgotten cousin. With her parents away on an extended anniversary trip, Seiya and Hana are left to share the house and fend for themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins as a lighthearted reunion soon spirals into something more. As if tugged by invisible threads, Seiya is drawn into the island\u2019s vibrant rhythm, uncovering secrets, forming bonds, and helping shape the course of Hana\u2019s dreams. Surrounded by eccentric residents, flirtation, friendly banter, and the strange calm of everyday life\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Static noise.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The cold, dark void. A pair of whirlpool eyes. Lives crushed. New hopes raised. Is it fate itself that guides Seiya\u2014or something else entirely?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443660/extras/ff426c012d1aa6c6f0062d4bb3b71834.avif?t=1755275780\" width=616 height=109 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443660/extras/cd83d3fcf0414eb8b46218a2229b4823.poster.avif?t=1755275780\" width=616 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443660/extras/cd83d3fcf0414eb8b46218a2229b4823.webm?t=1755275780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443660/extras/cd83d3fcf0414eb8b46218a2229b4823.mp4?t=1755275780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443660/extras/67c7e08a5b3e7b24dc53ba7e3242f143.poster.avif?t=1755275780\" width=616 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443660/extras/67c7e08a5b3e7b24dc53ba7e3242f143.webm?t=1755275780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443660/extras/67c7e08a5b3e7b24dc53ba7e3242f143.mp4?t=1755275780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443660/extras/d4db904a372308b232dbb1e28f09513f.poster.avif?t=1755275780\" width=616 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443660/extras/d4db904a372308b232dbb1e28f09513f.webm?t=1755275780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443660/extras/d4db904a372308b232dbb1e28f09513f.mp4?t=1755275780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443660/extras/a97070fc64954ebb9bb31cb93615938b.avif?t=1755275780\" width=616 height=109 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exploration!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander at your own pace. Collect items, stumble into secrets, and discover steamy (and not-so-steamy) events tucked away in the strangest corners. Who knows what you\u2019ll find when no one\u2019s watching?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Talk System!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hobbies? Relationships? Sex? Talk to the girls about everything and get to know them like never before.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dating Simulation Elements!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flirt. Bond. Grow together. Raise Affection, Love, Lust, and more to find your way into their hearts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Minigames!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against rivals in \u201cMusic Duels\u201d \u2014 a chance for Hana to hone her skills and prove her growth! Practice, rehearse, and study hard to outplay every opponent in these high-stakes rhythm showdowns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the mood for something different? Recruit friends and familiar faces through an exciting gacha system. Level them up and unleash their talents in intense, yet delightfully absurd, &quot;RPG Battles&quot;! Outsmart cunning foes and defeat brutal enemies by throwing pies at their faces.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hentai System!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your \u201cskills,\u201d unlock new interactions, and learn how to chain touches for the ultimate intimate experience with Hana. The main girl deserves only the best, doesn\u2019t she?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Extensive Storylines!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tears, laughter, awkward glances, and raw emotions. Each heroine offers a unique, emotional journey full of life, romance, and just the right amount of spice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443660/extras/0145e8f707c8165f3dea8173b87038fe.avif?t=1755275780\" width=616 height=173 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
